<section class="section light" id="about" data-screen-label="03 About">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why Now.</span>
        <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:28px;">About RegSymp</h2>
        <p>The financial services sector is at an inflection point. Open Banking is moving from policy paper to operational reality. The retail payments oversight regime is live. AML, sanctions and client-asset frameworks are tightening and the boards of every major institution are being asked harder questions than ever before.</p>
        <p>RegSymp brings together <strong>CEOs, Founders, CCOs, CROs, MLROs, COOs, General Counsels and Heads of Custody</strong> from the leading banks, asset managers, dealers, fintechs and crypto firms alongside their regulators, auditors and advisors to debate what comes next.</p>
        <a href="#why" class="btn-link" style="color:var(--navy); margin-top:8px;">Read the full programme thesis <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>

      <aside class="feature-stack" aria-label="What makes RegSymp different">
        <div class="feature-card"><span class="num">01</span><h3 class="h4">Industry-led</h3><p>Sessions chaired and curated by today's leaders in finance.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><span class="num">02</span><h3 class="h4">Exclusive audience</h3><p>Invitation only. 100 senior delegates.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-card"><span class="num">03</span><h3 class="h4">Local-first lens</h3><p>Leading regulators in the room with the international comparators that matter.</p></div>
        
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

